Yes, use the functions in the affy package that were designed to do this 
sort of thing.

Let's say you want the probe values from a few probesets:


probesets <- c("10338001","10338003","10338004")
probelist <- pm(Affy.Data, probesets, TRUE)

will give you a list of length 3, containing the probe values for these 
probesets.

