I think maybe you are looking for graph::ftM2graphNEL.  Here's an example:

library("graph")
s <- "symbol mirbase_id
2'-PDE hsa-let-7b
A2BP1 hsa-let-7b
AAK1 hsa-let-7b
ABCB9 hsa-let-7b
ABCC10 hsa-let-7b
ABCC5 hsa-let-7b
ACSL6 hsa-let-7b
ACTA1 hsa-let-7b
ACTR2 hsa-let-7b
ACVR1B hsa-let-7b
"

con <- textConnection(s)
df <- read.table(con, sep = " ", quote = "", header = TRUE)
ft <- as.matrix(df)
close(con)
g <- ftM2graphNEL(ft)
## or perhaps you want an undirected graph?
gu <- ftM2graphNEL(ft, edgemode = "undirected")

+ seth

-- 
Seth Falcon
Bioconductor Core Team | FHCRC


