From whuber at embl.de  Tue Feb 16 21:54:43 2010
From: whuber at embl.de (Wolfgang Huber)
Date: Tue, 16 Feb 2010 21:54:43 +0100
Subject: [BioC] DNA micro-array normalization
In-Reply-To: <8D08960C647E64438CE5740657CBBDC501F91060FF@iahcexch1.iah.bbsrc.ac.uk>
References: <3166fcd61002161147v58743996xabd2a97fc501b37e@mail.gmail.com>
